{
  "content": "<h1><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"TaxableSalesPerCustomer\">Taxable Sales per Customer</span></h1><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Action By Custom Customer Date Group On Port Sales Summary Tax TaxableSale TaxableSalesPerCustomer To ToDate Transaction Transactions\">The <em>Taxable Sales Per Customer</em> report provides a detailed summary of taxable transactions grouped by customer over a specified date range.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Amount Custom Customer From FromDate Is Port Sales Tax TaxableSale To ToDate Total\">This report helps you analyze your sales revenue from each customer, showing the total taxable sales amount for tax reporting purposes.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Create Custom Customer NewReport On Port Reports Sales Tax TaxableSale TaxableSalesPerCustomer To ToDate\">To create a new report, go to the <strong>Reports</strong> tab, click <strong>Taxable Sales Per Customer</strong>, then click the <strong>New Report</strong> button.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account AccountingMethod Count Create Method Port Rent Reports To ToDate\">You can create multiple reports covering different time periods or using different accounting methods to compare results.</p><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 inline-block pointer-events-none\"><div class=\"mt-4 ms-4 pe-8 items-center bg-neutral-100 p-4 border-neutral-200 border-s border-t rounded-ss-lg flex gap-4 shadow-[inset_0px_1px_0px_#fff]\"><span class=\"text-base font-bold text-neutral-300 [text-shadow:_1px_1px_0px_#fff]\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"TaxableSalesPerCustomer\">Taxable Sales per Customer</span></span><span class=\"text-neutral-300 hover:text-neutral-400\"><i class=\"fas fa-square-question\" style=\"font-size: 16px\"></i></span><span class=\"bg-white text-neutral-700 border border-neutral-300 font-semibold rounded-md py-2 px-4 text-sm\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"NewReport\">New Report</span></span></div></div>",
